{"3983000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Parasite Mutant", "steam_appid": 3983000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "Parasite Mutant is a sci-fi horror RPG set in the distant future. Psionic agent Nova was sent on a mission to an abandoned and secluded island city filled with horrifying creatures, not knowing that what happened on the island will completely change her fate.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat System</h2>Parasite Mutant uses ATC (Active Time Chains) which combines the popular Active Time Battle system used in RPGs of the late-90s and a 3-segment chain system. Players will need to time their actions on each segments and decide whether they want to save their energy and do a chain release.[/p]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the gauge fills up, players will need to dodge enemy attacks and launch their attack at the best possible time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that this little innovation of ours will bring an enjoyable and pleasant gameplay experience to our players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/c2010be76d6f9e57ee131b115a173505.poster.avif?t=1770979362\" width=468 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/c2010be76d6f9e57ee131b115a173505.webm?t=1770979362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/c2010be76d6f9e57ee131b115a173505.mp4?t=1770979362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art Style</h2>Parasite Mutant uses a semi-realistic anime art style and utilizes modern rendering techniques to give our players a HD visual experience. Additionally, we have introduced a retro filter and CRT filter to bring players back that late-90s to 2000s vibe.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/42a00eb8362c790ded1df66668f84d52.poster.avif?t=1770979362\" width=468 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/42a00eb8362c790ded1df66668f84d52.webm?t=1770979362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/42a00eb8362c790ded1df66668f84d52.mp4?t=1770979362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/a00d13e321e849778430f5f61292bc77.poster.avif?t=1770979362\" width=468 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/a00d13e321e849778430f5f61292bc77.webm?t=1770979362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/a00d13e321e849778430f5f61292bc77.mp4?t=1770979362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Setting</h2>Parasite Mutant is a survival horror game with a diverse array of horrifying mutants. In the game, players will solve various puzzles in search of answers and maybe uncover the horrifying secret of this universe.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/0416734df6705a9085cee05c973abf61.poster.avif?t=1770979362\" width=468 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/0416734df6705a9085cee05c973abf61.webm?t=1770979362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/0416734df6705a9085cee05c973abf61.mp4?t=1770979362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Up System</h2>Parasite Mutant uses the classic equipment progression system. Players can attach various modules onto their equipment, or enhance their equipment using Plus Points that can be obtained through combat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Game+</h2>Parasite Mutant has a New Game+ mode that allows players to inherit Plus Points from their previous playthrough. The New Game+ mode unlocks new locations where players have to continue to strengthen themselves and complete the final challenge.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outfit System</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/94364a963bc1601e4a1c845f37541c67.avif?t=1770979362\" width=748 height=896 /></span><br>You will be able to change hairstyles, hair colors, outfits, and more.</p>", "about_the_game": "Parasite Mutant is a sci-fi horror RPG set in the distant future. Psionic agent Nova was sent on a mission to an abandoned and secluded island city filled with horrifying creatures, not knowing that what happened on the island will completely change her fate.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat System</h2>Parasite Mutant uses ATC (Active Time Chains) which combines the popular Active Time Battle system used in RPGs of the late-90s and a 3-segment chain system. Players will need to time their actions on each segments and decide whether they want to save their energy and do a chain release.[/p]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the gauge fills up, players will need to dodge enemy attacks and launch their attack at the best possible time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that this little innovation of ours will bring an enjoyable and pleasant gameplay experience to our players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/c2010be76d6f9e57ee131b115a173505.poster.avif?t=1770979362\" width=468 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/c2010be76d6f9e57ee131b115a173505.webm?t=1770979362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/c2010be76d6f9e57ee131b115a173505.mp4?t=1770979362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art Style</h2>Parasite Mutant uses a semi-realistic anime art style and utilizes modern rendering techniques to give our players a HD visual experience. Additionally, we have introduced a retro filter and CRT filter to bring players back that late-90s to 2000s vibe.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/42a00eb8362c790ded1df66668f84d52.poster.avif?t=1770979362\" width=468 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/42a00eb8362c790ded1df66668f84d52.webm?t=1770979362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/42a00eb8362c790ded1df66668f84d52.mp4?t=1770979362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/a00d13e321e849778430f5f61292bc77.poster.avif?t=1770979362\" width=468 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/a00d13e321e849778430f5f61292bc77.webm?t=1770979362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/a00d13e321e849778430f5f61292bc77.mp4?t=1770979362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Setting</h2>Parasite Mutant is a survival horror game with a diverse array of horrifying mutants. In the game, players will solve various puzzles in search of answers and maybe uncover the horrifying secret of this universe.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/0416734df6705a9085cee05c973abf61.poster.avif?t=1770979362\" width=468 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/0416734df6705a9085cee05c973abf61.webm?t=1770979362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/0416734df6705a9085cee05c973abf61.mp4?t=1770979362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Up System</h2>Parasite Mutant uses the classic equipment progression system. Players can attach various modules onto their equipment, or enhance their equipment using Plus Points that can be obtained through combat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Game+</h2>Parasite Mutant has a New Game+ mode that allows players to inherit Plus Points from their previous playthrough. The New Game+ mode unlocks new locations where players have to continue to strengthen themselves and complete the final challenge.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outfit System</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/94364a963bc1601e4a1c845f37541c67.avif?t=1770979362\" width=748 height=896 /></span><br>You will be able to change hairstyles, hair colors, outfits, and more.</p>", "short_description": "This is a bio-horror RPG featuring a retro third-person semi-fixed camera and an ATC combat system that blends real-time and turn-based elements. You play as Nova, a Psionic Agent sent to investigate a mysterious abandoned city-island, ultimately uncovering the hidden truth and rewriting fate.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/105648f1b65b566414672580f1d70fdc2e375481/header.jpg?t=1770979362", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/08057d72be62cc617b4657ebf1eadc17c5803f74/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770979362", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/08057d72be62cc617b4657ebf1eadc17c5803f74/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770979362", "website": "https://www.iceseaheart.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Win 7 64bit / Win 8 / Win 10 / Win 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R)Core i3 2.7GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 or R9 270X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> at will</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Win 7 64bit / Win 8 / Win 10 / Win 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R)Core i5 3.2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 3060 or RX6600<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> at will</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Big Sur 11 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory